:"リアクションするのではなく、アクションを起こしてみては","ts":"1618314660.333700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":4,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UAUFDS92N","U8R597E9H","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YqaYw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"abc21fb7-a3bd-4628-8611-4fee6dc8258b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ダジャレ駆動開発","ts":"1618314645.333300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=5n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc6f9fa7-c824-40f7-a5c1-b2735a19f59c","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"ダジャレを押すスピードにすら勝ち負けを感じ始めている","ts":"1618314629.332700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":4,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UL6CFN8NR","U776661HA","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9Qh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b73e6a44-6076-4f98-927b-86ea7b4c624f","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"あとは大体sourceね","ts":"1618314606.332200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"dajare","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UAUFDS92N"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3U9I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b21cc58-e580-44e3-8f01-78680fbb1481","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"source の場合はローカル変数の問題もスクリプトローカルに閉じるから問題ないとして、autoload とか、再読み込みとかはわからない。","ts":"1618314603.332100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f2P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ecb0566-d630-46c6-a4a7-0ee7aa940f61","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ローカルのコピーは必要なんだろうか","ts":"1618314584.331400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"edf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a9299921-dbc7-4d4d-8c98-168218f287b6","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"後は大体そうですね","ts":"1618314564.330600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EM09"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e97ace65-aca5-4f4f-80a5-0b5213aae77a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"三段目は読んでexecuteじゃなくてパス指定してsourceでよさそう","ts":"1618314556.330300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vOZ0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8930b136-747d-47ba-89e5-79e071c71c99","type":"message","user":"UAUFDS92N","text":"あれ...僕の一段噛ませるの認識が間違ってる説がでてきた...\n```ファイルをダウンロードする\n↓\n特定の場所にルールに沿った名前で保存する(ローカルにあるものの場合は名前変えてコピー)\n↓\nそこのファイルの中身を読んでexecute```\nであってますか？","ts":"1618314510.329800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"++6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11c486ef-80ad-4681-9f8e-184159bb6fe6","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"`.cache` をとるにはちょっとオーバーキル感あるw","ts":"1618312723.327100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tNw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"555cd2b7-5fe0-4efe-9507-48c6c5ee2370","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"`.cache` を取るライブラリは存在するっぽいな \u003chttps://deno.land/x/xdg@v9.4.0\u003e","ts":"1618312322.326800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TuPf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"09ca089c-e985-4d61-9daf-054e8f79e184","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"みたいな？","ts":"1618312121.326100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vbv9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5edaf546-a69f-4256-912d-588ce83db537","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"\u0026gt; ローカル変数が全ファイルでかぶっちゃう問題の一段噛ませる方法が思い浮かばない…\n```vim.execute('source scriptfile', { scriptfile: '/Users/foo/.cache/denops-std/my-super-plugin/name_asdfasdfasdfadsf.vim' })```","ts":"1618312118.325900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original